“测量差异（归因错误）This is partly due to the fact that minority communities are controlled and policed more frequently, so they have higher arrest rates. However, one should not conclude that because people coming from minority groups have higher arrest rates therefore they are more dangerous as there is a difference in how these groups are assessed and controlled” (Mehrabi 等, 2022, p. 4) 部分原因是少数族裔社区受到更频繁的控制和监管，因此他们的逮捕率更高。然而，人们不应该得出这样的结论：来自少数群体的人被捕率较高，因此他们更危险，因为这些群体的评估和控制方式存在差异
