	note = {arXiv:2209.08230 [cs]
TLDR: A robust and constrained MARL algorithm (ROCOMA) is proposed that trains a robust EV rebalancing policy to balance the supply-demand ratio and the charging utilization rate across the whole city under state transition uncertainty.},
