	keywords = {Computer Science - Computation and Language, Computer Science - Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition},
	annote = {Comment: Accepted to CVPR 2024

“Model architecture: Despite their complexity, current LLMs lack true comprehension similar to human understanding. They rely on patterns in datasets rather than in-depth content understanding for response generation, which can produce structurally coherent but content-flawed outputs” (Deng 等, 2024, p. 17)
