	month = dec,
	year = {2023},
	note = {arXiv:2310.05470 [cs]
TLDR: This paper proposes a generative judge with 13B parameters, Auto-J, which is trained on user queries and LLM-generated responses under massive real-world scenarios and accommodates diverse evaluation protocols with well-structured natural language critiques.},
	keywords = {Computer Science - Computation and Language, Computer Science - Artificial Intelligence},
	annote = {Comment: Fix typos in Table 1

