	note = {arXiv:2206.04737 [cs]},
	keywords = {Computer Science - Computers and Society},
	annote = {Comment: Presented at 5th Annual ACM/AAAI AI Ethics and Society (AIES) conference

“Oversight refers to the mechanisms, processes, and institutions that monitor, evaluate, and enforce the compliance of LLMs with regulations, such as audits, reviews, certifications, or sanctions” (Deng 等, 2024, p. 21)
